<title>POLAND: POLISH NBP SETS CENTRAL ZLOTY PARITY RATE.</title>
<headline>POLISH NBP SETS CENTRAL ZLOTY PARITY RATE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland on Monday set the central parity rate for the zloty at 2.8673 to the dollar and at 1.8749 to the mark, the central bank said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
